  "source": "[\\normal.subgroup:of{G ::= (X, *, e)}]\nDeclares: N is \\group\nwhen: G is \\group\nsatisfies:\n. N \\:subgroup?:/ G\n. forAll:\n  . g \"in\" G\n  . n \"in\" G\n  where: n \"in\"? N\n  then:\n  . exists: m \"in\" G\n    suchThat:\n    . m \"in\"? N\n    . g * n = m * g\nDocumented:\n. called: \"normal subgroup of $G?$\"\n. written: \"H? \\vartriangleleft G?\"\n. description: \"A subgroup is normal when its left and right cosets agree for\n                every group element.\"\nId: \"0e5638e1-1109-4980-a652-2e795bed2e44\"",
